&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Principal Program Manager – Operations Management – London (hybrid) or Remote UK&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role exists to ensure Convera’s most critical operational, technology, customer, and business issues receive clear ownership, coordinated execution, and timely resolution.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
